Tous les messages front -> back auront la forme:
{
  "type": "...",
  "payload": { }
}

rejoindre un match:
{
  "type": "join_match",
  "payload": {
    "match_id": "abc123"
  }
}

lancer la partie (host uniquement):
{
  "type": "match_action",
  "payload": {
    "action": "start"
  }
}

inputs joueurs:
{
  "type": "input",
  "payload": {
    "action": "turn_left"	// turn_left | turn_right
  }
}



Le backend transmet, le jeu ajoute à son buffer d'action en attente à appliquer au prochain tick:
	game.start(match_config)
	game.apply_input(player_id, "turn_left")



L'instance de jeu dois faire à chaque tick:
  1. collect inputs
  2. apply buffered inputs
  3. move bikes forward
  4. add trail cells
  5. detect collisions
  6. update alive/dead
  7. emit state

{
  "type": "tick",
  "payload": {
    "tick": 152,
    "state": {
      "players": [...],
      "trails": [...]
    },
    "events": [
      {
        "type": "collision",
        "player_id": 2,
        "reason": "trail"
      },
      {
        "type": "player_eliminated",
        "player_id": 2
      }
    ]
  }
}

